{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉、唉、安洁！听说你要做个很厉害的蛋糕，是真的吗？」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「唉、唉、安洁！听说你要做个很厉害的蛋糕，是真的吗？」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0040", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "结女校学生B", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，要做一个巨大的蛋糕什么的，真的很不错啊～」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「安洁，要做一个巨大的蛋糕什么的，真的很不错啊～」", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jb0033", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "各务台校男生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么，是在哪里租了一个地方做这个吗？要给全校分蛋糕，也太厉害了吧？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "「什么，是在哪里租了一个地方做这个吗？要给全校分蛋糕，也太厉害了吧？」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "da0049", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，关于蛋糕的事，一天之内就传得沸沸扬扬了」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "「……嗯，关于蛋糕的事，一天之内就传得沸沸扬扬了」", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从今天早上开始，就一直有人来问这件事。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁碰到的每一个人都在和她聊蛋糕。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "安洁碰到的每一个人都在和她聊蛋糕。", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的班上也是全在聊这件事呢」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1018", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，三年级也在热烈讨论呢——都说菜菜要做一个巨大蛋糕真是很厉害呢」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「啊哈哈，三年级也在热烈讨论呢——都说菜菜要做一个巨大蛋糕真是很厉害呢」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0434", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是得到了全校好评啊」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2608", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到了从其他年级过来玩的两个人的话，安洁认真地点了点头。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "听到了从其他年级过来玩的两个人的话，安洁认真地点了点头。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这次也是责任重大呢」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4112", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说来本来就是给全校同学准备的，这种情况不如说是正合我意」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「说来本来就是给全校同学准备的，这种情况不如说是正合我意」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我笑着回应了耸了耸肩准备调侃我的濑名同学。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "我笑着回应了耸了耸肩准备调侃我的濑名同学。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，虽然说惊喜感完全被破坏掉了呢」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": "「啊哈哈，虽然说惊喜感完全被破坏掉了呢」", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2609", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但也正是因为这样，少爷，安洁感觉更有干劲了呢」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「但也正是因为这样，少爷，安洁感觉更有干劲了呢」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2610", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是啊，对我来说这也是值得感激的情况。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要好好地回应大家的期待，自然会使人热情高涨。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷，安洁会加油的」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2611", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天也要努力啊」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的——！我一定会的！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2612", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是这样，我们的热情又再次高涨起来。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，什么？今天放学后也要去烹饪教室吗？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "「嗯，什么？今天放学后也要去烹饪教室吗？」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0379", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，毕竟还没有选定蛋糕的口味嘛」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要选出一种也很难呢」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2613", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～这听起来也挺有趣的。我也去看看好了」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「嗯～这听起来也挺有趣的。我也去看看好了」", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0380", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也要去」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1019", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，我知道了。那就恭候各位光临了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「啊哈哈，我知道了。那就恭候各位光临了」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2614", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "时间立刻来到了放学之后。期末典礼渐近，谢天谢地，从今天开始就有半天休息日了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "时间立刻来到了放学之后。期末典礼渐近，谢天谢地，从今天开始就有半天休息日了。", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和安洁一起兴致勃勃地向烹饪教室走去——", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "我和安洁一起兴致勃勃地向烹饪教室走去——", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起本体，感觉还是小装饰更花时间呢」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「比起本体，感觉还是小装饰更花时间呢」", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2615", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，但装饰多了更符合节日氛围，也挺好的」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「嗯嗯，但装饰多了更符合节日氛围，也挺好的」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，我想用巧克力做一个圣诞老人。这个是叫巧克力塑形工艺吧～」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「是的，我想用巧克力做一个圣诞老人。这个是叫巧克力塑形工艺吧～」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2616", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，那就先把本体做好，剩下的时间再慢慢做小装饰怎么样？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「嗯嗯，那就先把本体做好，剩下的时间再慢慢做小装饰怎么样？」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～难得准备做一次蛋糕，我想用上鲜奶油来做呢……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「嗯～难得准备做一次蛋糕，我想用上鲜奶油来做呢……」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2617", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「鲜奶油应该不能放太久吧」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，所以我准备在前一天晚上努力做好」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2618", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果是这样的话，那就要尽可能地把其他事情都提前做好才行……」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「如果是这样的话，那就要尽可能地把其他事情都提前做好才行……」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还要订购材料呢。真是形势严峻啊，但也让人感觉干劲十足呢」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "「还要订购材料呢。真是形势严峻啊，但也让人感觉干劲十足呢」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2619", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "各务台校女生C", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，也让我来试吃一下吧—」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sc0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
