{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然我也在和安洁一起控制场面，但是大家七嘴八舌各说各话，根本无法收住。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": "当然我也在和安洁一起控制场面，但是大家七嘴八舌各说各话，根本无法收住。", "plain_idx": 427, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只能说……大家能帮忙还是很开心的。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「情况就是这样，爱理」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1022", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚刚结束了考试，又开始半天休假了……也就是说大家到寒假之前都很闲吧」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": "「刚刚结束了考试，又开始半天休假了……也就是说大家到寒假之前都很闲吧」", "plain_idx": 431, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4114", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家又正是喜欢活动的年纪」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1023", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样根本说不上活动，只是单纯的混乱吧」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4115", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是，结女学生之耻啊……」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4116", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
